{"id":"n56796-1-15","stage":4,"title":"발령 · 任命","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n56796-1-15-1","ko":"나 지방으로 발령이 났어.","zh":"我被调往外地工作了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지방으로","meaning":"地方","explanation":"지방：地方；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"지방","audio":"/audio/aa8a6ab7ce21201d9d47.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71323","senseId":"2","lemma":"지방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"발령이","meaning":"任命，调令","explanation":"발령：任命，调令；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"발령","audio":"/audio/f9ee0229d4577dceedef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56796","senseId":"1","lemma":"발령","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"났어.","meaning":"发生","explanation":"나다：发生；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"7","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"aa8a6ab7ce21201d","term":"지방","zh":"地方","audio":"/audio/aa8a6ab7ce21201d9d47.mp3","entryId":"71323","definition":"指在一个国家，除首都以外的地区。","pronunciation":["지방"]},{"id":"f9ee0229d4577dce","term":"발령","zh":"任命，调令","audio":"/audio/f9ee0229d4577dceedef.mp3","entryId":"56796","definition":"下达与某一职责或职位的任命、卸任或调动有关的命令；或指该命令。","pronunciation":["발령"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"发生","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"出现某种现象或事件。","pronunciation":["나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/da7e25c1d4919f7577ca.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n56796-1-15-2","ko":"그럼 가족들과 떨어져 지내야 하는 거야?","zh":"那就要和家人分开生活了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가족들과","meaning":"家庭，家人","explanation":"가족：家庭，家人；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；과：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"가족","audio":"/audio/7659575fd72a872b8d05.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44487","senseId":"1","lemma":"가족","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"떨어져","meaning":"分开，分离","explanation":"떨어지다：分开，分离；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"떨어지다","audio":"/audio/5360fef914150d393574.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89796","senseId":"13","lemma":"떨어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지내야","meaning":"度日，生活","explanation":"지내다：度日，生活；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"지내다","audio":"/audio/d56e2e0e23cd1763208c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17173","senseId":"1","lemma":"지내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하는","meaning":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","explanation":"하다：应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"7659575fd72a872b","term":"가족","zh":"家庭，家人","audio":"/audio/7659575fd72a872b8d05.mp3","entryId":"44487","definition":"主要指聚在一起生活，由婚姻、父母、子女、兄弟等的关系构成的社会单位；或指其成员。","pronunciation":["가족"]},{"id":"5360fef914150d39","term":"떨어지다","zh":"分开，分离","audio":"/audio/5360fef914150d393574.mp3","entryId":"89796","definition":"断绝关系或分开过。","pronunciation":["떠러지다"]},{"id":"d56e2e0e23cd1763","term":"지내다","zh":"度日，生活","audio":"/audio/d56e2e0e23cd1763208c.mp3","entryId":"17173","definition":"以某种程度或状态过日子。","pronunciation":["지ː내다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/fbc50dc4ee78492e142c.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.44,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=56796","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":126,"sequenceScore":2.2667,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["那就要和家人分开生活了吗？","我被调往外地工作了。","你在哪里弄丢手机了？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我被调往外地工作了。","你在哪里弄丢手机了？","那就要和家人分开生活了吗？"],"answer":2}]}
